# The preview origin the playground boots Mimic with (BootOptions.previewOrigin),
# read at build time. A wildcard serves each published endpoint from the root of
# an origin of its own (ADR-0044); every hostname of it must serve this same
# build. Leave it empty to serve previews from the site's own origin.
# See docs/deploying.md.
VITE_PREVIEW_ORIGIN=https://*.mimicjs.com
